    {
      "id": "p0178-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "An intimidating knight named Undyne first appears in Waterfall. She loathes the main character at first, but the player can change her attitude over time. As such, Undyne sounds scary and ferocious in some situations, polite and friendly in others, and sometimes all of these things at once. Luckily, Toby provided many notes about Undyne's constant attitude changes.",
        "raw": "An intimidating knight named Undyne first appears in Waterfall. She loathes\nthe main character at first, but the player can change her attitude over time.\nAs such, Undyne sounds scary and ferocious in some situations, polite and\nfriendly in others, and sometimes all of these things at once. Luckily, Toby\nprovided many notes about Undyne's constant attitude changes.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29476853,
          0.23029286,
          0.88679297,
          0.31481429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29272132,
          0.22957857,
          0.91129816,
          0.31588571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9,
          10
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "令人畏惧的骑士 Undyne 首次登场于瀑布。起初她厌恶主角，但玩家可以逐渐改变她的态度。因此，Undyne 有时凶狠可怕，有时礼貌友好，有时甚至兼而有之。幸好，Toby 对她不断变化的态度留下了许多说明。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29752204,
          0.22886429,
          0.90925094,
          0.31838571
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.4635714285714286,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29752204,
          0.22886429,
          0.90925094,
          0.31838571
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0178-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In Japanese, Undyne uses the pronoun watashi. This suits her in several ways:",
        "raw": "In Japanese, Undyne uses the pronoun watashi. This suits her in several ways:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29710236,
          0.33029286,
          0.90006917,
          0.34277857
