    {
      "id": "p0178-b005",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "It conveys a sense of neutral courtesy, professionalism, and honor In some contexts it can give off a sense of femininity It can be safely used in a wide variety of situations",
        "raw": "It conveys a sense of neutral courtesy, professionalism, and honor\nIn some contexts it can give off a sense of femininity\nIt can be safely used in a wide variety of situations",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.34147579,
          0.35788571,
          0.84782419,
          0.40538571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.3043188,
          0.35717143,
          0.84915489,
          0.40645714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          12,
          13,
          14
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "• 传达中性、礼貌、专业、重荣誉的感觉。\n• 某些语境下，也能显出女性气质。\n• 适用范围广，在各种场合都不容易出错。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
