    {
      "id": "p0178-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the English script, Undyne often shouts \"ngaaaah\" when frustrated. Because grunts, growls, and other sounds often \"feel\" different in different languages, Undyne's growls were translated as nuaaaa throughout the Japanese script.",
        "raw": "In the English script, Undyne often shouts \"ngaaaah\" when frustrated. Because\ngrunts, growls, and other sounds often \"feel\" different in different languages,\nUndyne's growls were translated as nuaaaa throughout the Japanese script.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29803384,
          0.60435,
          0.90925094,
          0.65422143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29272132,
          0.60363571,
          0.91129816,
          0.65529286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          26,
          27,
          28
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英语剧本中，Undyne 恼火时经常大吼“ngaaaah”。哼声、吼声等声音在不同语言中，往往给人不同的“感觉”，因此日文剧本把她的吼声统一译成 nuaaaa。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 79,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
